=== C1: App.D g0,g1,g2 ===
g0(x->xH) = -1/12*cb^2/xH
g1(x->xH) = (-9 - 5*cb^2)/12
g2(x->xH) = (cb*(-1/2 - (5*cb^2)/3 + 6/(-1 + xH)^2 - (3*(1 + xH)*Log[xH])/(-1 + xH)^3))/4
g0(x->0)  = (-3*cb^2)/(16*xH)
g1(x->0)  = -3/4
g2(x->0)  = (cb*(2 + 3*Log[xH]))/4
series g0 in 1/xH (xH->inf): (-3*cb^2*ee)/16
series g1 in 1/xH (xH->inf): -3/4 - (cb^2*ee*x*(-5 + 4*Log[1/(ee*x)]))/4

