=== C3: g_C exact vs approximation ===
g_C(1,100)  = -0.00044457412943434593
-mh^2 c^2/(4v) at tanb=100 = -0.0015879065040650406
ratio = 0.27997500375257367
g_C(c) expansion = (15625*c^2)/984 + (15625*c^4)/3936 - mH^2/492
i.e. g_C = s/(2v)[ mh^2 c^2/2 - mH^2(1+c^2/2) ] + O(c^4):  (62500*c^2 + 15625*c^4 - 8*mH^2 + 4*Sqrt[1 - c^2]*(2*mH^2 + c^2*(-15625 + mH^2)))/3936
vanishing c vs mH (tanb=100): c_van = 1/(6*Sqrt[217]) -> tanb = 6*Sqrt[217]
mH where paper c=1/tanb gives vanishing: mH = 5/(4*Sqrt[2])

